The [[Holdall]] is a [[Bag]] normally obtained by catalytically converting [[Leather Armor]] using a [[Goobert]] or with any [[Hammer]]. If crafted from a hammer, the item is not consumed. It has 6 backpack slots, and for every neutral item inside, gives 8 {{icon/block}}, up to a maximum of 48, meaning that it could theoretically give even more {{icon/block}} than the [[Leather Armor]] it's made from, with a 12 tile improvement in space occupied.
